          "answer": "You can find the location of the in-person event on the event booking page. Along with this, you will even receive an Email & Whatsapp message with the event location and prerequisites.",
          "order": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "0bdc15b6-4e43-422e-aa14-2469692b40bd",
          "question": "How can I cancel my event registration?",
          "answer": "To cancel your event registration, follow these steps:\r\nStep 1: Go to the hamburger menu on top left of your app and select Bookings.\r\nStep 2: Select Manage Booking for the event you want to cancel.\ufeff\r\nStep 4: Tap on Cancel Appointment.",
          "order": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "fc83170f-2a37-4001-b3cb-73670a18be7d",
          "question": "How  do I register for a webinar/offline event?",
          "answer": "To register for an in-person or online event, follow these steps:\r\nStep 1: Go to the Events section from the bottom navigation bar.\r\nStep 2: Select the event you want to be a part of.\r\nStep 3: Click on Register. You\ufeff will then get an event registration message pop-up.",
          "order": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "40b245bd-6c2f-428e-beba-9168e6dfb833",
          "question": "Where can I find the joining link to the webinar?",
          "answer": "To join a webinar, follow these steps:\r\nStep 1: Go to the Bookings section from the hamburger menu on the top left of the App.\r\nStep 2: Select the event you want to join.\r\nStep 3: Tap on Join Now.",
          "order": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "8c7bc841-9762-410d-a5e9-8bb4ffedd040",
      "category": "General",
      "order": 9,
      "faqs": [
        {
          "id": "392ecaf6-4967-4d0f-83b5-5f316254c553",
          "question": "How can I change my registered mobile number?",
          "answer": "To meet regulatory requirements, we don\u2019t allow changes to registered mobile numbers right now.\r\nHowever, you can create a new account to access your favourite accounting content on Miles One.",
          "order": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "78e0af7a-1c2e-4d5b-9a42-bb4b26891dfd",
          "question": "How can I resolve the lag in my App?",
          "answer": "To fix the lag, you can try the following solutions:\r\nCheck device settings: Ensure enough battery, storage, and memory for smooth app performance.\r\nRestart your device: Refresh system processes and clear temporary files for better functionality.\r\nUpdate your software: Keep your operating system and apps current to avoid bugs or compatibility issues.\r\nClear app cache: Free up storage and fix potential slowdowns caused by cached data.\r\nClose background apps: Improve speed by freeing up memory from unused apps.\r\nSwitch or reset network: Resolve connectivity issues by trying a different network or toggling airplane mode.",
          "order": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "e1c44bae-b9b1-4134-b47e-0e95c0be636e",
          "question": "How can I change my registered e-mail address?",
          "answer": "To change your registered e-mail address, follow these steps:\r\nStep 1: Go to the hamburger menu on top left of your app and select profile.\r\nStep 2: Click on edit profile and update the required fields, in this case, your e-mail address.\r\nStep 3: Tap on save to apply your changes.",
          "order": 4
        },
        {
          "id": "274b14db-b10d-4a49-942c-51a4e6aa13d7",
          "question": "How can I change my career preferences in account settings?",
          "answer": "To change your career preferences in profile, follow these steps:\r\nStep 1: Go to the hamburger menu on top left of your app and select profile.\r\nStep 2: Click on edit profile and update the required fields, in this case, your career preferences.\r\nStep 3: Tap on save to apply your changes.",
          "order": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "d3e24f34-7565-45df-bc8d-0b6503604c9f",
          "question": "I want to update my profile",
          "answer": "To update your profile details, follow these steps:\r\nStep 1: Go to the hamburger menu on top left of your app and select profile.\r\nStep 2: Click on edit profile and update the required fields.\r\nStep 3: Tap on save to apply your changes.",
          "order": 6
        }
      ]
    }
