        "bio": "Daniel Alberson is the CEO & Co-Founder of Agentive, an AI-powered platform helping auditors dramatically accelerate audit workflows. Based in the San Francisco Bay Area, he is focused on transforming how audit professionals analyze financial records, perform procedures, and generate documentation using intelligent AI copilots.\r\n\r\nPrior to founding Agentive, he worked as a Product Manager at Meta, where he contributed to the development of next-generation augmented reality glasses. Earlier in his career, he spent over seven years at EY, where he led digital transformation initiatives across industries\u2014designing innovative technology solutions ranging from predictive queueing systems for global theme parks to mobile tools that help technicians diagnose and resolve complex service issues in the field.\r\n\r\nHe began his career in IT Audit at EY, specializing in internal controls over financial reporting and SOC audits, giving him a deep understanding of financial systems and audit processes. His background combines auditing expertise, product innovation, and design thinking to build tools that reshape how financial professionals work.",
